{
 "chapter": 27,
 "title": "Everything, in order",
 "duration": 155.5666666666652,
 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 6.466666666666657,
   "end": 9.901632653061215,
   "text": "investment: spend now, earn later",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.099999999999987,
   "end": 12.950294784580485,
   "text": "some of it is sunk \u2014 never got back",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.166666666666652,
   "end": 16.05179138321994,
   "text": "the future arrives a bit at a time",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.26666666666665,
   "end": 18.478412698412683,
   "text": "the chance usually keeps",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.86666666666672,
   "end": 24.214648526077152,
   "text": "so waiting pays: bad half cut, good half kept",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 24.433333333333415,
   "end": 26.95854875283455,
   "text": "not about disliking risk",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.166666666666778,
   "end": 30.72517006802732,
   "text": "waiting costs profit \u21d2 a level to act at",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.933333333333476,
   "end": 34.039047619047764,
   "text": "the trigger sits above the textbook line",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.43333333333346,
   "end": 38.666757369614636,
   "text": "how far: choppiness and the cost of money",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.86666666666676,
   "end": 43.70226757369624,
   "text": "base case \u2248 double \u00b7 rough trade > 3\u00d7",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.90000000000006,
   "end": 45.99564625850346,
   "text": "cheaper money RAISES it",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.20000000000003,
   "end": 49.93265306122452,
   "text": "in reverse: absorb losses before quitting",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 51.333333333333286,
   "end": 55.48394557823124,
   "text": "the do-nothing band \u2248 9\u00d7 wider",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.69999999999992,
   "end": 58.77346938775502,
   "text": "up and back down \u2014 the effect stays",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.96666666666655,
   "end": 61.71247165532868,
   "text": "cushion the downside \u21d2 early in",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.89999999999985,
   "end": 65.6790929705214,
   "text": "many firms \u21d2 an industry that looks frozen",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 70.7333333333329,
   "end": 81.03827664399049,
   "text": "Give up at nought point seven two. Build at one point six two. And in between, a wide stretch where the right thing to do is nothing.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.56666666666608,
   "end": 89.21963718820803,
   "text": "It does not say firms are irrational. It says the opposite.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.66666666666605,
   "end": 93.14866213151865,
   "text": "It does not say waiting is always right.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 93.56666666666601,
   "end": 99.07183673469322,
   "text": "And it does not apply where a rival can snatch the opportunity away from you.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.19999999999918,
   "end": 114.05827664399011,
   "text": "The farmer keeps going because closing is final. Staying open keeps the good years possible, and that is worth more to him than the losses are costing him.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.89999999999912,
   "end": 127.20956916099686,
   "text": "And I do not build, because building is final too. Waiting another year is worth something, and this year's numbers are not yet good enough to pay for it.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 130.03333333333234,
   "end": 140.01201814058857,
   "text": "One more thing before we stop. A government somewhere spent hundreds of billions of pounds on a policy that assumed none of this was true.",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 144.93333333333211,
   "end": 147.0986394557811,
   "text": "the whole ladder, in order",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 147.23333333333204,
   "end": 149.9094784580486,
   "text": "not irrational \u00b7 not always right",
   "voice": "n"
  },
  {
   "start": 150.03333333333197,
   "end": 153.33641723355873,
   "text": "next: a policy that assumed none of it",
   "voice": "n"
  }
 ],
